      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇！这是…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9211552539969b6cc1f417709e8a29c81ad5d15476537c4b66c4872c88ff0210",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2aa5f8e7fa21d5b0005e54b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5519ac75491c8eda44dcba3845f0cc9ddf77ce3c570898f75b64424098256c9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dd93d1993f171b433e335a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是激动呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01881d87b72653df3ddb8bd5ef9f4195eb94bd8f5adda5acd881ef7186e1489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7b6afc21d7d918ea40fd21c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af90383b3d3324d9df2061abc0a1485d62fa2ce25477223dffdf8a34ca4589fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e2ee1661120cba9098457f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯～～～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "91f82feb8d0348024475a8842ce4069780ab54546ddcee895d2bb4988982db9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:375b3618f2c782004736cd92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀…？训练员？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4353b242cd7db190ff3d001233cd880f95668eb51cf45333446c305e2d4cd274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25ee1096764b7a5c73aa22ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哇哇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f107cbc3b3b0734ab6250cd4f06b4945831e1c370b89820b38e7919560152c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be35714e813820fd1932ae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶诶～～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ebb73227a74ee5329b91743f33c36e1f5093bbbd32bc212be691d14081fddba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6257286f587ecc5a32de12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说明天是这个哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da69e8cedd66e5c29036217e68fea4ecf71cf5f350ae4825c8884510d13dcaa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4234d3a3e18593de33c3a082",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『明媚的笑容和充足的睡眠，\n是最棒的治疗法』…\n重新审视下体力的管理计划比较好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "252c05f43db3ba1e78bc1066682e20b2fa1d44f706e140b92584d3cef2bc156b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b04b6e4ccb6c123a05f41e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……\n为了不让护卫的各位太过担心，\n今天的训练就到此为止怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb97f8510d3274decda6c6629b514cf176a60f4c0a42b627e457bd10f2365e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df56a5ee720370912e10800",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼～♪身体好轻盈～！\n说不定能像妖精一样，\n自由地在空中飞翔呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7c7619f4d0ae4d0d8f818c94512b83fd7c9570bd532c7f38f705cd58ae05d36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51752d899f68a7371f168fbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得心情很好～♪\n啊，是因为今天早上看见了四叶草吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc87df86dbccb1a39ecaac9a91d406495257fe30f6f97f55da70f16e840876b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c06eea44a58508e4e84ec51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备运动已经做好啦～♪\n所以呢，\n什么时候开始训练都没问题哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0b5cb8dd444a748b5256024ac137b4d33c73e90974cdf804599268271628654",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74c40a2a64ebe73fa55f23e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鞋子的保养也非常棒♪\n呵呵，就算是小矮妖看见了，\n也会吓一大跳吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6113aa5df4b23e3d24ad0531378c9304a866ac22e1a3a68bd9a92837d3743320",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12daa52ecbf183d1514f61a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也请您多加指导♪\n那么…！开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd1e96cb4cc9e5af4dcca04334082787449a0bb0eb7b08ddcb8b5a55c5025ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc58fef14ecb014c4c1909fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贵安。\n今天安排了怎样的训练呢？\n不管怎样的训练都可以的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f603c7ce01e1940808868e6b88b92dabe510d378619bae762f0ca6d0c171e916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3933d14fc4a0330a1ef93688",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～…为了转换心情，\n去找找看四叶草吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e271c03ee0fc20982c5069706179c5ff470d4a577cb31ab4b283e3cbe9b4a6b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea10085286b489810ca58d56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…不打起精神来的话…\n好不容易才得到父亲的许可，\n可不能放弃…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7873b28eed510024180a186919b3d686d199b9aec707f5366a60f10cd2b8aa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838ba69bb2247153878a3fd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…啊，抱歉。\n开始训练了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "63da923cac113f333dd94ba94ed9bf6cfff6d5fe2303b54ff2e076140815fcf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e40510952b28440eeb41f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说实话，情况不容乐观…\n但我已经下定决心了。\n一定要在我该走的道路上前行…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd6fd27c6f48c1e6ef7db1f8f4e4595f30bd0bd2b9bbe9664d2f898dc5b7fce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e30397f1358bc8fe2c1e8c10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦，还要继续参加比赛吗。\n我会继续尽全力做到最好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ade76794e4ef8364966e9dd1928179dc176607ae62eaa1ca3c669e93dcfb71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c6af9a4d29e0f5d1b202eae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也该自爱一点哦？\n如果错失时机，\n能赢的比赛也会赢不了的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36aa36518b9e035d40d2eb10e5b28ca245420d5975c2dbf5c3819f25eaaef7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afe1169cfb7d732103ad0357",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼～♪今天早上，\n城堡的大家发来了为我打气的短信哦！\n好～要加油咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c46c90cffb7ef85a5e0c133e6e62e546156b6f0fe6deb32a25ddaa4cb04cfcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b4ed7b9e5841e673b2ed96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态绝佳，心态正好！\n作为幸运物的三叶草押花\n也有好好地放在口袋里哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "687d06edbc04e1fda172389d173070b3709a814441de19f879af989d40de9763",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68120c9da65b20ac79e9def9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“好好见证我现在的实力吧！”——\n怀着这种愿望奔跑的话，\n就能给大家留下美好的回忆了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a9011cf5f09d263759650a650bfc879a4d7c5617e20a98517e0e172a01988dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49398c354af79d82c138c131",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是赢了的话记得拍纪念照哦！\n漂亮的胜利和满足的笑容，\n都敬请期待哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "65cfc38f350064a716f7290bed27100461d5f1161a72a7b757e404c13f5bc177",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c85f4cbfb982bdbcb598b90c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！今天的毛色也很好吧…？\n你看，我这家族特有的尾巴，\n好像比平时更闪闪发光呢…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d18dd8424d5452f75624e5f1a84ee80d0fadeab4e7edab2febf4206e2206e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef82c74f7d7a08a628cf4e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，准备出赛了…！\n一定要取得胜利，\n在大家面前凯旋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "668b52511f209f4e43fcf8e508c1ca607bab66f664ae349ca385d8ec9441c760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf07c5b652ad7f93a3b8125",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Noblesse oblige…\n取得胜利这件事，\n也是决心成为竞技者的我的使命…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a9db64da94e1327240c29028251cf409d0c5420b309a28571eba809ff8eca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b92507e862bf09eddecb29c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了跑出能留下回忆的比赛，\n我也会加油的！ 对了♪\n庆功宴的话，就举办茶话会吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa7097548ff71573512263ebf9004faface0dc3ab6624543d645b65616a79bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65a2f7051e8ff519774f1abe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要能发挥出平时的实力，\n毫无疑问是能取胜的。\n那么就准备出赛啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db843a67d218b86e1f77cf6d605909c1c14b7e7c0ff3d8a3be8cc917c02779b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95eec8639a18483623a4564d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚稍微有些沉重…\n说不定是妖精的恶作剧…！\n唔唔！那就把妖精们也超越吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "531766f8097e97866964904b2d026507630843a44fbcd01cb9a0ee6e90dfceef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c196cc69137607a0029864f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不能说状态万全…\n不过我也背负着故乡的各位的思念，\n所以不会在此败北哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0125c1d96b807be98bc2531c69530778265c6d39c81ac88c4a60b3d325dfa9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "20033"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
